  "description": "New series! Andrew and I are playing Split Fiction, the split-screen co-op game where two writers get trapped inside their own stories, and it is basically two video games at once.\n\nIn Part 1 we sign up with Rader Publishing, pick Mio (sci-fi) and Zoe (fantasy), get sucked into the simulation, run up walls in Mio's sci-fi world, get chased by ogres (or trolls? orcs?) in Zoe's fantasy world, find a glitch in the Matrix, swing around a neon city, get stuck on one VERY long rooftop puzzle, and finally get our first real fight.\n\nWho do you think is the optimistic one and who's the pessimistic one? Let us know in the comments!\n\nIf you enjoyed it, like and subscribe so you don't miss Part 2.\n\nCHAPTERS\n{CHAPTERS}\n\n#SplitFiction #CoopGaming #SplitScreen #LetsPlay #Gameplay #FirstPlaythrough #Part1",
