  "thumbnails": "Times are in the EDITED video (raw-stream time in brackets). Pause there and screenshot, or ask me to export full-res PNGs.\nSame style as South Park: big face reaction(s) + one big game element + 2-4 words. With two of you on cam, put both faces big on one side (Lelac in front).\n\n1. \"TWO GAMES IN ONE?!\"  (best fit for title #2, works as a series template)\n   - Game: the split screen itself, sci-fi on one side and fantasy on the other. The Mio & Zoe character cards at {T:381} are also strong.\n   - Faces: your reactions at {T:1339} (\"Crash Bandicoot?\") or {T:1652}\n   - Text: \"2 GAMES IN 1?!\" with a jagged split line down the middle\n\n2. \"IT MAKES NO SENSE\"  (matches title #4, relatable co-op frustration)\n   - Game: the crane/rooftop puzzle around {T:2930}\n   - Faces: confused or frustrated at {T:2949}, with Andrew pointing\n   - Text: \"NO SENSE.\" or \"WE'RE STUCK\"\n\n3. \"MEAT DOG?!\"  (highest curiosity)\n   - Game: the meat dog / ogre area at {T:1311}\n   - Faces: shocked at {T:1311}\n   - Text: \"WHAT IS THAT\" + a red circle around the dog\n\n4. \"GLITCH IN THE MATRIX\"\n   - Game: the purple glitch cutscene with Mio and Zoe at {T:1690} (great colors)\n   - Faces: any surprised frame from {T:1634}\n   - Text: \"WE FOUND A GLITCH\"\n\nRecommendation: #1 as the Split Fiction series template (keep the split-line layout every episode), #2 or #3 for this episode."
